{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The scene features a phone positioned on the top side and a carrot located on the left side. For every pizza present in the image, it is situated below the phone. Associated with the pizza, there is a camera located directly below it. A watch is also present, which is smaller than the camera. Finally, a pair of scissors is positioned below the watch and is aligned vertically with the carrot.",
